# Unit rules for Chinese: lengths, masses, volumes, areas, speeds, information, power, temperature and ages. Canonical names are the
# English ones used by every language. Forms are matched by their longest match after a number (公里 before 米), so no spaces are assumed.

[unit]
millimeter | length | 毫米, mm
centimeter | length | 厘米, 公分, cm
meter | length | 米, 公尺, =m
kilometer | length | 公里, 千米, km
inch | length | 英寸
foot | length | 英尺
mile | length | 英里
milligram | mass | 毫克, mg
gram | mass | 克, =g
kilogram | mass | 公斤, 千克, kg
tonne | mass | 吨
jin | mass | 斤
pound | mass | 磅
ounce | mass | 盎司
milliliter | volume | 毫升, ml
liter | volume | 升, 公升, =L, =l
gallon | volume | 加仑
cubic meter | volume | 立方米, m³
square meter | area | 平方米, 平米, m2, m²
square kilometer | area | 平方公里, 平方千米, km2, km²
hectare | area | 公顷
mu | area | 亩
kilometer per hour | speed | 公里/小时, 千米/小时, 公里每小时, 千米每小时, 公里/时, 千米/时, km/h
meter per second | speed | 米/秒, 米每秒, m/s
byte | information | 字节, =B
kilobyte | information | =KB, =kB
megabyte | information | =MB
gigabyte | information | =GB
terabyte | information | =TB
petabyte | information | =PB
watt | power | 瓦特, 瓦, =W
kilowatt | power | 千瓦, =kW
megawatt | power | 兆瓦, =MW
celsius | temperature | 摄氏度, ℃, °C, °c, ºC, ˚C
fahrenheit | temperature | 华氏度, ℉, °F, °f, ºF, ˚F
# Without 摄氏 or 华氏, 度 alone is a degree of unnamed scale, as in English "20 degrees".
degree | temperature | 度

# 摄氏180度, 华氏72度, 零下5度, 零下8摄氏度: a word before the number names the scale or the sign.
[zh.unit-prefix]
celsius | temperature | 摄氏 | 度, 摄氏度
fahrenheit | temperature | 华氏 | 度, 华氏度
degree | temperature | 零下 | 度 | negate
celsius | temperature | 零下 | 摄氏度 | negate
fahrenheit | temperature | 零下 | 华氏度 | negate

# 5岁, 五岁, 两周岁, 六个月大. An age needs its unit; 5年 is a length of time.
[age.word]
year | 岁, 周岁, 岁大
month | 个月大
